<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:#f5f7f5;padding:24px;" width="100%">
	
		<tr>
			<td align="center">
			<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:620px;max-width:100%;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e6e2;" width="620"><!-- Header -->
				
					<tr>
						<td style="background:#2f4233;padding:22px 28px;">
						<div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#cbd8ce;font-weight:bold;">AI AGENT GOVERNANCE</div>

						<div style="font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;margin-top:4px;">Agent Request Approved</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- Intro -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:26px 28px 14px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Hello,<br />
						<br />
						Your request to create the <strong>{{{Case.AgentName__c}}}</strong> AI Agent has been approved.<br />
						<br />
						You can now start building your agent in Dust.</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- Details -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:6px 28px 22px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-size:14px;color:#242424;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;" width="160">Agent</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{Case.AgentName__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Category</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{Case.UseCaseCategory__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Purpose</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;">{{{Case.AgentPurpose__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- Support -->
					<tr>
						<td style="background:#f1f5f2;padding:20px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;"><strong style="color:#2f4233;">What happens next?</strong><br />
						<br />
						The Dust Admin team will support you during the build to help ensure:
						<ul style="margin:8px 0 0 20px;padding:0;">
							<li style="margin-bottom:5px;">the right data sources and access levels are used;</li>
							<li style="margin-bottom:5px;">connectors and actions are appropriate for the use case;</li>
							<li style="margin-bottom:5px;">execution time and credit consumption are optimised;</li>
							<li style="margin-bottom:5px;">the output is adapted to the user need;</li>
							<li>the appropriate sharing scope is defined.</li>
						</ul>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- Important note -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:20px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;"><strong>Important:</strong> this approval allows you to start building the agent. Its final configuration and sharing scope should be reviewed before making it available to a wider audience.</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- CTA -->
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:8px 28px 28px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation">
							
								<tr>
									<td style="background:#2f4233;"><a href="{{{Case.link}}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Open Agent Request </a></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<!-- Footer -->
					<tr>
						<td style="border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;padding:16px 28px;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;">Need help? Contact <strong>dust@carmignac.com</strong>.<br />
						<br />
						Dust Admin Team<br />
						Carmignac AI Agent Governance</td>
					</tr>
				
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
</body>
</html>